  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Smart speakers, Alexa displays, and streaming players do not solve the computer connection needs reflected in my purchases.",
    "Buying a tablet mount does not mean I want another tablet, and a memory card is not useful without a storage need and a compatible device."
