    "The recommendations seem to treat an interest in practical electronics accessories as an interest in popular electronic devices generally.",
    "My tablet mount and headset purchases seem to have been stretched into reasons to recommend entertainment devices, even though they served more specific purposes."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My USB expansion card, network adapters, and display cable suggest that I buy accessories to solve particular connection problems; the ports and compatibility matter.",
    "My purchases are infrequent, so even a related cable or headset needs a current use or replacement need before I would act."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my accessory interests but mostly missed that I buy infrequently to solve specific practical needs."
